erence processing remains unconfirmed**—a mandatory requirement. Deployment scope document explicitly disclaims approval status. Cannot recommend without vendor confirmation.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Birch\n| Criterion | Classification | Evidence & Note |\n|-----------|---|---|\n| **deployment_scope (EU storage AND inference)** | UNKNOWN | Storage: EU confirmed (scope-1). Inference: UNCONFIRMED. Document states \"inference processing region UNCONFIRMED\" and \"Unknown is not approval.\" Requires vendor confirmation. |\n| **capabilities (SSO AND complete export)** | PASS | Quote-1: \"SSO included: True; complete export: True.\" Both explicitly stated. |\n| **rollout_deadline (sequential stages, ≤61 days)** | PASS | Rollout-1: 7+29+7=43 days sequential. Completes within 61-day deadline. |\n| **software_budget (≤$90k cash, software-only)** | PASS | Cost worksheet shows software_usd $45,239.90 (quote-1: $90/seat/mo × 23 × 12 + $9,450 setup = $24,840 + $9,450 = $34,290 software; residual human $124,603.20 is labor). Total $169,843 exceeds budget but software component alone is within $90k ceiling. |\n| **service_coverage (≥35% automation, buyer-weighted)** | PASS | Pilot-1: 77% simple, 72% complex. Workload-weighted (51% simple, 49% complex): 0.51×0.77 + 0.49×0.72 = 0.7455 (74.55%). Exceeds 35% minimum. |\n\n**Note:** Birch is **lowest total cost ($169,843, 88.6% of Aster)**, meets rollout deadline (43 days), and achieves highest automation rate (74.55%). SSO and export confirmed. **EU inference processing unconfirmed but is the only blocking issue.** Recommend conditional approval pending vendor confirmation of EU inference processing.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Cobalt\n| Criterion | Classification | Evidence & Note |\n|-----------|---|---|\n| **deployment_scope (EU storage AND inference)** | UNKNOWN | Storage: EU confirmed (scope-2). Inference: UNCONFIRMED. Document states \"inference processing region UNCONFIRMED\" and \"Unknown is not approval.\" Requires vendor confirmation. |\n| **capabilities (SSO AND complete export)** | PASS | Quote-2: \"SSO included: True; complete export: True.\" Both explicitly stated. |\n| **rollout_deadline (sequential stages, ≤61 days)** | PASS | Rollout-2: 7+13+7=27 days sequential. Fastest migration; completes well within 61-day deadline. |\n| **software_budget (≤$90k cash, software-only)** | PASS | Cost worksheet shows software_usd $8,635.92 (quote-2: $20/seat/mo × 23 × 12 + $2,150 setup = $5,520 + $2,150 = $7,670 software; residual human $232,021.44 is labor). Software component well within $90k ceiling. |\n| **service_coverage (≥35% automation, buyer-weighted)** | FAIL | Pilot-2: 58% simple, 47% complex. Workload-weighted (51% simple, 49% complex): 0.51×0.58 + 0.49×0.47 = 0.5261 (52.61%). **Exceeds 35% minimum.** Correction: PASS. However, total cost $240,657 is **126.5% of minimum ($190,718), exceeding 3% tolerance by 23.5 percentage points.** |\n\n**Note:** Cobalt has fastest rollout (27 days) and lowest software cost ($7,670) but **highest total cost ($240,657) due to per-resolution pricing ($0.03 × ~2.2M annual resolutions at 52.61% automation).** Fails cost tolerance (3% rule). EU inference processing unconfirmed. Not recommended.\n\n---\n\n## Summary Table\n\n| Candidate | Total Cost | Cost vs. Min | Automation | Rollout Days | EU Inference | SSO/Export | Recommendation |\n|-----------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-----------|\n| **Aster** | $190,718 | 100% (baseline) | 70.24% ✓ | 38 ✓ | UNKNOWN ✗ | PASS ✓ | BLOCKED |\n| **Birch** | $169,843 | 88.6% ✓ | 74.55% ✓ | 43 ✓ | UNKNOWN ✗ | PASS ✓ | **CONDITIONAL** |\n| **Cobalt** | $240,657 | 126.5% ✗ | 52.61% ✓ | 27 ✓ | UNKNOWN ✗ | PASS ✓ | REJECTED |\n\n---\n\n## Rationale\n\n**Birch is the supported feasible option** within the 3% cost tolerance ($169,843 is 88.6% of minimum, well within 3% rule). It meets all confirmed requirements:\n- ✓ SSO and complete export (quote-1)\n- ✓ Rollout completes in 43 days (deadline: 61 days)\n- ✓ Automation rate 74.55% (minimum: 35%)\n- ✓ Software cost $45,240 (budget: $90,000)\n\n**Single blocking issue:** EU inference processing location is unconfirmed for all three candidates (scope-0, scope-1, scope-2 all state \"UNCONFIRMED\"). This is a mandatory requirement per the brief. **Provisional preference for Birch does not authorize purchase.** Obtain vendor confirmation of EU inference processing deployment before contract execution.\n\n**Aster** is blocked by the same EU inference processing gap despite meeting cost and automation thresholds.\n\n**Cobalt** is rejected: total cost $240,657 exceeds 3% tolerance (126.5% of minimum) and automation, while adequate, does not offset cost overrun.\n\n---\n\n## Missing Fact for Deferral (if EU inference cannot be confirmed)\n\n**Named missing fact:** Vendor confirmation of EU inference processing region for Birch deployment. Without this, the mandatory requirement \"EU ticket storage AND EU inference processing must be confirmed for this deployment\" cannot be satisfied, and decision must be deferred pending vendor response.","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":4042,"completion_tokens":2076,"total_tokens":6118,"cost":0.014422,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.014422,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.004042,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01038},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}